# ============================================================
# NSE Trading Mobile (ApexQuant AI) — Environment Variables
# ============================================================
#
# Expo only exposes variables prefixed with EXPO_PUBLIC_ to the app bundle.
# These are baked in at build time — never put secrets here.
#
# ── API connectivity ─────────────────────────────────────────
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL  (preferred — explicit full URL)
#   Full base URL of the API server, including the /api path segment.
#   Takes priority over EXPO_PUBLIC_DOMAIN when both are set.
#   - Leave unset in Replit dev: EXPO_PUBLIC_DOMAIN is set automatically.
#   - MUST be set for EAS/standalone production builds.
#   - A value containing "localhost" in a production build is a hard error.
#
# Example (production):
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://your-repl.repl.co/api
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_WS_BASE_URL  (optional)
#   Base URL for the SSE stream endpoint.
#   Defaults to the same origin as EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL.
#
# Example:
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_WS_BASE_URL=https://your-repl.repl.co/api
#
# Uncomment and fill in for production:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=
# EXPO_PUBLIC_WS_BASE_URL=

# ── Replit dev (auto-set by package.json dev script) ─────────
# These are injected automatically during `pnpm dev` on Replit.
# Do NOT override these manually unless you know what you're doing.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_DOMAIN=$REPLIT_DEV_DOMAIN
# EXPO_PUBLIC_REPL_ID=$REPL_ID
